{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is approached, take it, otherwise move and scan, then inspect it. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <SubTree ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = InspectObject    />\"",
